---
title: PXE boot + Proxmox auto-installer flow
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Node as Cluster node (B/C/D)
  participant DHCP as UDW DHCP
  participant PXE as pxe-host (NixOS)
  participant Repo as nginx-static (ISOs + answer files)

  Node->>DHCP: DHCPDISCOVER (PXE)
  DHCP-->>Node: DHCPOFFER + next-server=pxe-host
  Node->>PXE: TFTP request iPXE binary
  PXE-->>Node: iPXE chainload payload
  Node->>PXE: HTTP GET netboot.xyz menu
  PXE-->>Node: netboot.xyz menu
  Node->>Repo: HTTP GET proxmox-ve.iso
  Repo-->>Node: ISO stream
  Node->>Repo: HTTP GET proxmox-{b,c,d}.toml (per MAC)
  Repo-->>Node: Answer file
  Node->>Node: Unattended Proxmox install
  Node->>Node: Reboot into installed OS
